17:inner exception as specified in section 8.10.7.\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3937:#### 8.10.9 Publication, visibility, and reproducibility\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:3971:#### 8.10.10 Current code and migration\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4010:#### 8.10.11 Acceptance gates\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4075:### 8.11 Mutable objects and collections over cells\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4145:  a cell. Section 8.10 adds the shared entry to that same identity object;\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4211:  Section 8.10 admits its common entry projection for invocation; the\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4239:## 9. Standard library and FFI architecture\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4249:### 9.1 The four-layer model\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4275:### 9.2 Layer 1: pure modules\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4286:### 9.3 Layer 2: language intrinsics and preludes\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4319:### 9.4 Layer 3: object system desugaring\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4342:### 9.5 Layer 4: system I/O and effects\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4366:### 9.6 Module distribution\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4377:## 10. Diagnostics and error reporting\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4384:### 10.1 Boundary policy\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4404:### 10.2 Qualified outcome maps\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4418:### 10.3 Proposed diagnostic record\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4440:### 10.4 Diagnostic datoms on the stream\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4454:## 11. Determinism and isolation\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4511:## 12. Phased roadmap\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4513:### Phase 0: SPI, ANTLR boundary, and stream pipeline\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4540:### Phase 1: Dynamic pilot, Python followed by JavaScript\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4589:### Phase 2: Java static and class-based pilot\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4609:### Phase 3: PHP web and associative-array pilot\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4627:### Phase 4: Language extension SDK and documentation (open SPI)\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4649:### Phase 5: Multi-host verification and integration benchmarks\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4678:## 13. Verification laws\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4680:### 13.1 Laws\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4712:### 13.2 SPI compliance test matrix\ndocs/design/yang.antlr.md:4746:### 13.3 Completion criteria\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
