{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"agent_message","text":"The descriptor branch preserves the existing admission check. I’m checking two edge cases the focused suite may miss: nil or false entry slots, and whether `invoke-value`’s `(apply f args)` re-enters the new routing for raw closures or non-callable values.\n"}}
